1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,233
Comfyrizz turns one short brief into a finished, narrated launch video.

2
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:08,900
Every scene is compiled into integer frames, and every asset is drawn as code.

3
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:13,433
No GPU, no cloud, and no network calls while it renders locally.

4
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:16,767
Comfyrizz is open source under the MIT license.

5
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:18,667
Clone it, run it, and remix it.
